Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: display labels for the 3 new platform activity
 types (item 15, frontend)

The dedicated Activity Log page's type badge falls back to the raw
type string when it isn't in TYPE_LABELS/TYPE_ICONS - added entries
for the 3 new event types the backend now emits (new_dealer,
new_listing, sale_completed) so they show proper labels ('New
Dealer', 'New Listing', 'Sale') instead of the raw snake_case value.

The dashboard's own Recent Activity widget needed no change at all -
it already renders title/message/createdAt directly without going
through TYPE_LABELS, so the new event types display there
automatically.
